145
00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:43.423
Good.

146
00:18:44.257 --> 00:18:45.727
Get over there.

147
00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:24.932
Come on, Saint Francis.

148
00:19:26.466 --> 00:19:27.568
