Okay. The bag.

174
00:24:31.605 --> 00:24:32.840
You can have it.

175
00:24:32.940 --> 00:24:34.875
It's yours, okay?
I don't-- I don't want it.

176
00:24:41.682 --> 00:24:43.117
Well, thanks, Pete.

177
00:24:45.019 --> 00:24:47.655
I had a feeling you'd be
a reasonable bloke.

178
