209
00:27:21.242 --> 00:27:23.944
<i>Fucking</i>
<i>shoot me! Shoot me!</i>

210
00:27:24.044 --> 00:27:25.614
Tell me what's happened--

211
00:27:29.049 --> 00:27:30.151
Hello?

212
00:27:32.319 --> 00:27:33.354
Hello?

213
00:27:34.121 --> 00:27:35.122
Hello?

214
00:27:51.839 --> 00:27:55.242
